        {
          "baseline": 85.44,
          "text": "Stacked fractions in prose",
          "x": 72.0
        },
        {
          "baseline": 102.24,
          "text": "\"",
          "x": 247.12
        },
        {
          "baseline": 110.88,
          "text": "#",
          "x": 247.22
        },
        {
          "baseline": 115.21,
          "text": "Inline, a fraction of fractions such as $ shrinks to the text style, and a continued fraction $1 +",
          "x": 72.0
        },
        {
          "baseline": 125.28,
          "text": "%",
          "x": 247.1
        },
        {
          "baseline": 131.04,
          "text": "&",
          "x": 248.8
        },
        {
          "baseline": 135.84,
          "text": "!,",
          "x": 238.35
        },
        {
          "baseline": 139.68,
          "text": "!",
          "x": 248.93
        },
        {
          "baseline": 144.01,
          "text": "frac{1}{1 + frac{1}{x}}$ or a quotient & enlarges its line. The line after them keeps its ordinary",
          "x": 72.0
        },
        {
          "baseline": 150.0,
          "text": "!+",
          "x": 238.35
        },
        {
          "baseline": 154.08,
          "text": "!",
          "x": 248.93
        },
        {
          "baseline": 165.36,
          "text": "height.",
          "x": 72.0
        },
        {
          "baseline": 187.92,
          "text": "REVIEW: every level of a stacked fraction has the size and spacing Word gives it, each equation is",
          "x": 72.0
        },
